# ntfy configuration for career-agent notifications.
#
# Copy to ntfy.conf (gitignored) and edit. notify.sh reads this when NTFY_URL
# is not already set in the environment.
#
# THE TOPIC IS THE PASSWORD. On ntfy.sh there are no accounts and no access
# control: anyone who subscribes to the same topic string receives every
# notification sent to it. These notifications carry recruiter names, role
# titles and the fact that a search is underway.
#
# Option A - as requested. Memorable, and guessable by anyone who tries the
# words. Use only if you accept that the contents are effectively public.
#NTFY_URL="https://ntfy.sh/SuperbJobAGI"
#
# Option B - recommended. Same name, plus a random secret. You paste it into
# the iOS app once and never type it again, so the suffix costs you nothing
# and makes the topic unguessable.
NTFY_URL="https://ntfy.sh/SuperbJobAGI-780e44267231bd68b9f8dc5a"
#
# Option C - a self-hosted or reserved ntfy server with real access control.
# Set the token too; notify.sh sends it as a bearer token.
#NTFY_URL="https://ntfy.example.com/SuperbJobAGI"
#NTFY_TOKEN="tk_..."
